      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792703819350,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A single front door: TLS, auth, rate limits, routing by\nhost and path. In AWS: the ALB/NLB + whatever proxy\nsits behind it. In Kubernetes: an Ingress controller\nor a Gateway.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A single front door: TLS, auth, rate limits, routing by\nhost and path. In AWS: the ALB/NLB + whatever proxy\nsits behind it. In Kubernetes: an Ingress controller\nor a Gateway.",
